Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.28,0:00:03.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,Getting an AI agent to work with\\Nyour company's data can be tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:06.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Your data lives in OneLake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.37,0:00:10.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,Connecting your agent to it,\\Nin a way your IT team can approve,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:10.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,is the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:13.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Krusgraph is the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:15.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,Sign in with Microsoft Entra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:17.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,Krusgraph reads your tables
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:19.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,with your permissions and\\Nmaps how they connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.07,0:00:21.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then it checks that map against your data.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.54,0:00:25.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,From one checked plan,\\Nyou get what you need:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:30.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,a report, a semantic model, an API,\\Nand an ontology your agents can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:32.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,Everything is read-only by default,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.75,0:00:35.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,and you see a dry run\\Nbefore anything is created.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:38.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Your agent. Your data. Connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:43.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,Krusgraph, for Microsoft Fabric.
